    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "can you give me a quick rundown on the economic impact of a Green New Deal style policy? i need a summary of the most likely consequences, specifically looking at the risks for market instability and potential job losses in traditional energy sectors.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
